docs {
  POST /api/library/purchase e o endpoint de compra (nao existe POST /api/orders).
  Publica OrderPlacedEvent no RabbitMQ e OrderPaid na fila SQS (Lambda de e-mail).
  Aguarde ~3s e consulte a biblioteca.
}
